	quest.3757FE3AC6956B65.quest_desc: [
		"&6采石场清理模式 &7——唯一正确的挖矿方式&r"
		"&7Unlike the &cnormal building mode&r, which fills every mined block with useless &bdirt&r — turning your hard work into a messy, unproductive wasteland — the &aQuarry Clearing Mode&r &7is designed for &btrue excavation&r. It &aremoves blocks completely&r, &bdrops their raw resources&r, and leaves behind a &eclean, empty space&r. &6No dirt. No clutter. Just pure, efficient mining.&r"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&b如何设置&r"
		"&7别再用右键点击手中的卡片了——那又慢又不准，早就过时了。正确的&e方法&r很简单：站在&bRFTools Builder&r前，&e按住shift点击&r&aQuarry Shape Card&r。建造器会立即进入&9点选择模式&r。"
		""
		"&7首先，&9看向你想开始的角落&r — &c左键单击&r 锁定。然后，&9移动到对角线另一端的角落&r — 即使在高处或低处 — 再&c左键单击&r。建造器将&a自动检测这两个点之间的完整3D体积&r。 &a无需数字。无需猜测。无需犯错。&r"
	]
	quest.38B360FC8FA3627D.quest_subtitle: "Pyrolyse 在早期能帮到你，但未来你更需要它来制作 3 个。"
